      "urn:ontology:cocoarynth#hasDescription": [
        {
          "@value": "Small bean-to-bar maker of single-origin chocolate. Buys fermented, dried cocoa beans from cooperatives, an estate and producer groups in five countries, makes two-ingredient bars in its Portland factory, and sells through grocers, specialty shops, caf\u00e9s, an online marketplace and an overseas distributor.",
